@host = http://localhost:5100
@customerId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@productId = 01a0be3f-65a9-712a-8520-74cb0f7e4bbd

### Check out the basket filled in Basket.http - expect 201 Created + Location
POST {{host}}/api/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": "{{customerId}}" }

### Check out an EMPTY basket - expect 422
POST {{host}}/api/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222" }

### One order - expect 200 OK
GET {{host}}/api/orders/01a0c3cf-2094-7060-9b8d-5783f4d9c5eb

### All orders of the customer - expect 200 OK
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": "{{customerId}}" }

### Cancel the order - expect 204 No Content
POST {{host}}/api/orders/PASTE-THE-ORDER-ID-HERE/cancel

### Cancel it AGAIN - expect 422
POST {{host}}/api/orders/PASTE-THE-ORDER-ID-HERE/cancel
